            "description": "The components carrying each value of dataclass.customer, by entity type. A module Search because Gryphon cannot write this: a labelless aggregate (a count over every node regardless of type) grouped by entity type and by the value of a dimension key taken from a Search input. The runner reads the values from the dimension dictionary, so a value added there appears here with no change to this Search.",
